."},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall|FR=Départ des ombres}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Indigo-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","text":"French: Départ des ombres"}],"full_text":"Shadowpoint is a power that enables its user to fire a shuriken at a target with great speed and velocity. It is a favored spell of Santiago.\n\nHistory\n\nSantiago used this spell to break Alisa Clairmont's handbag when he saw her attacking Sophie Casterwill. He later used it in the burger cafe against the Suits. [All Work and No Pay]\n\nSantiago used the spell against the Blood Spiral during the battle at the Fortress of Iron Will.\n\nInternational Names\n\nFrench: Départ des ombres","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E14 Santiago Shadowpoint.png\n| aura  = Indigo<br>Violet ([[TCG]])\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Santiago]] <br> [[Zhalia Moon]] ([[TCG]])\n| first = \"[[All Work and No Pay]]\"\n}}\n'''Shadowpoint''' is a power that enables its user to fire a shuriken at a target with great speed and velocity. It is a favored spell of [[Santiago]].  \n\n== History ==\nSantiago used this spell to break [[Alisa Clairmont]]'s handbag when he saw her attacking [[Sophie Casterwill]]. He later used it in the burger cafe against the [[Suits]]. {{source|All Work and No Pay}}\n\nSantiago used the spell against the [[Blood Spiral]] during the battle at the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. {{Template:Source|The Spiral War}}\n\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall|FR=Départ des ombres}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Indigo-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","categories":["Indigo-aura spells","Magic","Offensive spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:2479","status":"resolved","target_title":"TCG","label":"TCG","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2479"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2055","status":"resolved","target_title":"Santiago","label":"Santiago",